%% Option B. Method tree: terms
%% simulation process split by method, as ASMO does for atomistic methods. New methods and
%% purposes become new classes. Added for comparison.

    Computing["<b>computing process</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process"]:::local
    Simulation["<b>simulation process</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::local
    DFT["<b>DFT calculation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::proposed
    MD["<b>molecular dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::proposed
    FEM["<b>finite element simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::proposed
    CFD["<b>computational fluid dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::proposed
    PhaseField["<b>phase field simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::proposed
    MonteCarlo["<b>monte carlo simulation</b><br>PMD_0000862 monte carlo simulation"]:::local
    AtomisticMC["<b>atomistic monte carlo simulation</b><br>PMD_0000527 atomistic monte carlo simulation"]:::local
    MachineLearning["<b>machine learning</b><br>PMD_0000821 machine learning"]:::local
    AIMD["<b>ab initio molecular dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000504 ab initio molecular dynamics simulation<br><br>now under DFT and MD"]:::changed
    EmpiricalMD["<b>empirical potential molecular dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000631 empirical potential molecular dynamics simulation<br><br>now under MD"]:::changed
    DFTOpt["<b>DFT geometry optimization</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>method and purpose combined"]:::proposed
    FEMStatic["<b>FEM static analysis</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>method and purpose combined"]:::proposed
    Note["<b>What to look at</b><br>Every new method needs a class here, and every method with a purpose needs another one.<br>Purpose and scale classes (structural optimization, multiscale, high throughput) do not fit this axis.<br>Methods that combine others (ab initio MD) need two parents."]:::note

    Computing --> Simulation
    Simulation --> DFT
    Simulation --> MD
    Simulation --> FEM
    Simulation --> CFD
    Simulation --> PhaseField
    Simulation --> MonteCarlo
    MonteCarlo --> AtomisticMC
    Simulation --> MachineLearning
    DFT --> AIMD
    MD --> AIMD
    MD --> EmpiricalMD
    DFT --> DFTOpt
    FEM --> FEMStatic

